Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. TensorFlow Lite runtime, Task Library and pretrained detection models
   (EfficientDet-Lite0/1/2, SSD MobileNet v1) published by Google /
   The TensorFlow Authors. Used under the license stated on each
   component's source page.

2. Training data for the polyp detection models
   (efficientdet-lite2-polyp.tflite and related polyp models in
   app/src/main/assets):

   Wang, Guanghui, 2021, "Replication Data for: Colonoscopy Polyp
   Detection and Classification: Dataset Creation and Comparative
   Evaluations", Harvard Dataverse, V1.
   https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/FCBUOR

   Associated article:
   Li K, Fathan MI, Patel K, Zhang T, Zhong C, Bansal A, Rastogi A,
   Wang JS, Wang G. Colonoscopy polyp detection and classification:
   Dataset creation and comparative evaluations. PLoS ONE. 2021.
   https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0255809

   Dataset license: Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain
   Dedication (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/), as
   stated on the Harvard Dataverse page above.

   The dataset is not redistributed in this repository. Attribution is
   given here as good scholarly practice; CC0 does not require it.

